-- test: ADR 0067 amendment (Leonardo, 2026-10-06), B04_hof_passes_data_on_c: a T value decided by comparing T values goes where a value of T is expected (a lambda, a higher-order function, a function result, an `edit` binding or a field of the body), which edition 0.2 rejects in the generic body; the control, sound, is rejected there, a cost Leonardo accepted, since accepting it soundly would need re-checking lambdas (spec/07 §7 rule 8, #92)
-- spec: spec/07 §7
-- expect: error U4001 at src/b04_hof_passes_data_on_c.una:8:92
module b04_hof_passes_data_on_c

run[U](x: U, k: fn(U) -> Int) -> Int = k(x)

apply[T](a: T, b: T, p: T, q: T, k: fn(T) -> Int) -> Int = run(if a == b then p else q, k: k)

pub leak(s: Int) -> Int = apply([s], b: [0], p: [], q: [1, 2], k: fn(xs) -> xs.len)
